From: @rezoss_reza <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Allow suggested replies on upgraded devices

HoneyBoard restricts its modern suggested-replies capability to devices
launched on API 35 or newer. Force the capability flag on upgraded devices
while leaving the account, work-profile, user preference and policy checks
intact.

---
diff --git a/smali_classes2/N8/a.smali b/smali_classes2/N8/a.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/N8/a.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/N8/a.smali
@@ -1794,6 +1794,8 @@
     const/4 v0, 0x0
 
     :goto_1f
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
+
     sput-boolean v0, LN8/a;->K:Z
 
     invoke-static {}, LN8/a;->e()LOa/b;
-- 
